                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Stop. You are unlogged traffic on a logged corridor. Every traveler on this wire goes in my ledger - name, team, throughput - and right now you are a blank row. I do not tolerate blank rows."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The pylons carry more than current. They carry records, and records are the only honest thing left on this road. Battle me and I will log you properly, or turn around and stay a rumor."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Axel Datastream",
                    Label: "default"
